---
// Showcase of the custom systems we have built and run in production.
// Plain-English, owner-first copy: Credit Cards, Tap-to-Pay & Customer Financing first.
interface Props {
  more?: boolean; // show the "see every system" link (home page only)
}
const { more = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section id="systems"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Custom business tools</div><h2>Not just websites.<br><span class="grad">Tools that run the business.</span></h2></div>
  <p class="sub">Online payments, customer financing, booking tools, quote calculators and follow-up systems we built and keep running every day. You tell us what is slowing you down—we build the fix.</p></div>
  <div class="bento">
    <div class="tile w4 reveal"><span class="live mono"><i></i>in production</span><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20M6 15h4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Credit Cards, Customer Financing &amp; Text Invoices</h3><p>Stop waiting weeks for a check in the mail. We set you up to take credit cards, debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, bank transfers and "Pay Over Time" customer financing right from your phone or website—plus optional Cash App, Strike or Bitcoin Lightning to skip 3% card swipe fees.</p>
      <div class="paylog mono" aria-hidden="true">
        <div><span><span class="k">→</span> text invoice sent from phone</span> <span class="dim">$350.00 · Driveway repair</span></div>
        <div><span><span class="k">→</span> paid by Card / Apple Pay</span> <span class="ok">✓ paid on the spot</span></div>
        <div><span><span class="k">→</span> receipt &amp; review text sent</span> <span class="ok">✓ automatic</span></div>
      </div></div>

    <div class="tile w2 reveal"><span class="live mono"><i></i>in production</span><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L3 21l1.9-6.4A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/><path d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01"/></svg></div>
      <h3>24/7 Website Receptionist &amp; Quote Chaser</h3><p>Answers customer questions day or night using your exact prices and service area, grabs their phone number and job photos, and automatically follows up on open quotes so you close more jobs.</p></div>

    <div class="tile w2 reveal"><span class="live mono"><i></i>in production</span><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4zM3 6h18M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Online Stores &amp; Equipment Catalogs</h3><p>Sell products, parts, merch or service packages online with live inventory, shipping labels, automatic order emails and one simple screen to manage every order.</p></div>

    <div class="tile w2 reveal"><span class="live mono"><i></i>in production</span><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9M3 9h18v11H3zM9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Customer Portals &amp; Multi-Seller Sites</h3><p>Let customers log in to view past invoices, book time slots or pay deposits—or run a full marketplace where multiple sellers list and sell under your brand.</p></div>

    <div class="tile w2 reveal"><span class="live mono"><i></i>in production</span><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3M8 11h6M11 8v6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>New-Homeowner &amp; Permit Lead Finder</h3><p>Instead of buying shared leads from Angi, our system checks public property sales, building permits and county records daily so you reach new local customers first.</p></div>

    <div class="tile w4 reveal sys-cta">
      <div><h3>Doing something by hand that should be automatic?</h3><p>Past-customer text blasts, voice-to-quote estimators, crew job boards, or connecting QuickBooks to your phone. Tell us what is eating up your week and we will send a flat, written quote to fix it.</p></div>
      <div class="sys-cta-btns">
        <a class="btn primary magnetic" href="/contact/">Start a project <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        {more && <a class="btn magnetic" href="/systems/">See how custom builds work</a>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>
